<script setup lang="ts">import {computed,onMounted} from 'vue';import {runs} from '../stores/runs';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import MatchMetrics from '../components/MatchMetrics.vue';import MatchFlow from '../components/MatchFlow.vue';import UnmatchedTable from '../components/UnmatchedTable.vue';onMounted(runs.load);const result=computed(()=>(runs.items.value.find(r=>r.id==='demo-run')||runs.items.value.find(r=>r.status==='completed'))?.result)</script><template><PageHeading index="00 / 勾稽总览" title="先核对身份与口径，再比较金额。" note="金额以整数分保存。先做含拒配节点的全局一对一，再对剩余委托与凭证联合分配合并组；不自动核销、不连接银行。"/><template v-if="result"><MatchMetrics :result="result"/><div class="reconcile-overview"><section><div class="ledger-heading"><h2>候选连接 · 可追溯ID</h2><a href="#/results">查看完整匹配底稿 ↗</a></div><MatchFlow :rows="result.phase_one.matches.slice(0,5).concat(result.phase_two.groups.slice(0,3))"/></section><aside class="margin-note"><p class="eyebrow">POLICY SNAPSHOT</p><h2>本次匹配口径</h2><dl class="policy-notes"><div><dt>金额容差</dt><dd>{{result.policy.amount_tolerance}} 分</dd></div><div><dt>日期距离</dt><dd>≤{{result.policy.max_days}} 天</dd></div><div><dt>委托引用</dt><dd>{{result.policy.require_reference?'必须相同':'软成本比较'}}</dd></div><div><dt>合并候选 / 组上限</dt><dd>{{result.policy.max_candidates}} / {{result.policy.max_group_size}}</dd></div></dl><p>同币种、同往来方始终是硬约束。双侧未配项各付拒配分数，禁配边不会被强行选中。</p><p>第二阶段在候选与金额限制内联合分配余项，优先多配凭证、再降总金额差；触及搜索上限时标记未证最优。所有消耗只属于本次试验。</p></aside></div><section class="unmatched-section"><h2>仍需人工核查</h2><UnmatchedTable :rows="result.unmatched.receipts.slice(0,4).concat(result.unmatched.milestones.slice(0,4))"/></section></template></template>
